No font files are committed or compiled into any binary. The canonical Noto
fonts (Noto Sans/Serif, KR, JP and per-script families, SIL OFL-1.1, no
Reserved Font Name) are downloaded at a pinned google/fonts revision, verified
by length and sha256, and cached under runtime/fonts together with each
family's unchanged OFL.txt; Web WOFF2 subsets are generated from that cache.
Sources and copyright holders are listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Font bytes
are not relicensed under this project's dual license. Catalog integrity does
not certify shaping or fallback parity.

The native CSS engine includes Stylo and Stylo traits, whose published package
metadata declares MPL-2.0. This project's dual license does not replace it.
The CPU renderer uses AnyRender/Vello CPU; the optional GL adapter uses published
Rust interfaces to external Skia. Native system-font lookup is enabled.
Redistributed executable bundles require their own complete dependency and
font/asset license review before release.

Collected upstream examples, internal research, generated captures, local
compiler executables and runtime downloads are not public source assets.
Library-authored fixtures and canonical SVG icons remain part of the source.

